# AZ-104 Domain 1: Identities and Governance (Azure for Students Lab Guide)

---

## 01 Overview & Strategy
In enterprise environments, identity is the **primary security perimeter**. This lab guide provides a complete, hands-on framework for mastering **Domain 1 (Identities and Governance)** of the **AZ-104: Microsoft Azure Administrator** certification. 

To account for the limitations of **Azure for Students** accounts (which lack Microsoft Entra ID P1/P2 licensing), this guide utilizes **smart workarounds** (e.g., *Security Defaults*, *Selected Group SSPR*, *Custom RBAC*) to deliver full production-grade governance zero-cost.

---

## 02 Azure for Students: Feature & Licensing Strategy

| Premium Enterprise Feature | Free Student Workaround | Exam Relevance | Strategic MCT Note |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Conditional Access Policies** | **Security Defaults** | High | Forces MFA across all users; zero licensing required. |
| **Self-Service Password Reset (SSPR) - All** | **SSPR - Selected Group Scope** | High | Scoping SSPR to a specific group bypasses bulk licensing limits. |
| **P2 Identity Protection** | **RBAC & Activity Logs** | Medium | Enforces Least Privilege access boundaries. |

---

## 03 On-Premises to Azure Mapping

| On-Premises Infrastructure | Azure Cloud Equivalent | Key Operational Difference |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Active Directory Domain Services** | **Microsoft Entra ID** | Flat identity directory using REST APIs (OAuth/OIDC) instead of LDAP/Kerberos. |
| **Active Directory Bulk Import** | **Entra Bulk User Creation (CSV)** | Automated identity creation for M&A/acquisition scenarios. |
| **Delegation of Control Wizard** | **Custom Azure RBAC Roles** | JSON-defined action matrices scoped at Subscription or RG level. |
| **Group Policy Objects (GPOs)** | **Azure Policy & Resource Locks** | Subscription-wide compliance enforcement and non-deletion locks. |

